{"1580010": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "HUMANS CONNECT", "steam_appid": 1580010, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<strong><u>HUMANS CONNECT</u></strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1580010/extras/904c8f2013a10e7771de3e1838c85c71.avif?t=1732928464\" width=504 height=900 /></span><br><br>An action-packed Boss-Rush Game, each character has a unique set of moves and abilities. To unlock all the characters mythos and the lore of the game, you must beat the chapters.<br><br><br><strong><u>Character Description</u></strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1580010/extras/6864aafe86763bd7df824da78ba60ea9.avif?t=1732928464\" width=150 height=150 /></span><br><br>NightWolf:<br>A loyal wolf pet-like creature with a purpose of protecting his masters from any harm.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1580010/extras/58645d892b48516eacd2ad75d8b4b8f1.avif?t=1732928464\" width=150 height=150 /></span><br><br>Julia:<br>Unaware of the power lurking inside her, Julia is a brave young girl, always willing to risk her life for others.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1580010/extras/d05517fd4b89bbfc3da2049ec330d37f.avif?t=1732928464\" width=150 height=150 /></span><br><br>Inpu:<br>A creature that resembles Anubis, with a mysterious purpose. Inpu stumbles on Julia and suddenly decides to take her away because he sensed something dangerous from her.<br><br><br><strong><i>This game has been entirely developed by a Single Person.</i></strong>", "about_the_game": "<strong><u>HUMANS CONNECT</u></strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\